{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The first comparison command was malformed: `gcc` treated the shared libraries as C source, so that result is invalid. I’m rerunning it with the compiler input modes separated and `set -e` so failures cannot look like a pass."}}
