{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The comparison exposed a real mismatch: using Rust `println!` writes through Rust’s stdout buffering, which changes ordering when the caller also uses C `stdio`. I’m switching logging to C `puts` so the library shares the same stdout stream behavior as the original."}}
